---
import '@fontsource-variable/manrope';
import '../../styles/bastrop37.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#090d19"/><meta name="description" content="BASTROP37 — a rear chase motorcycle experiment. Slide, turbo, deploy blades, and spring over traffic."/><title>BASTROP37 — Afterhours</title></head>
<body>
<main>
<header class="mast"><a href="/" class="back">↙ BACK TO DAYLIGHT</a><span class="edition">AFTERHOURS / EXPERIMENT 001</span><a href="/bastrop37/assets/">ASSET GARAGE ↗</a></header>
<section class="identity"><div><p class="eyebrow">MIDNIGHT MOTOR DIVISION</p><h1>BASTROP<span>37</span><i>•</i></h1></div><p class="build">05 / SEA-WALL ESCAPE<br/><span>6 KM. 90 SECONDS. REACH THE WATER.</span></p></section>
<section class="cabinet" aria-label="Motorcycle riding prototype">
<div class="telemetry"><span><b class="live-dot">●</b> <span id="sector">CITY EXIT / TRAFFIC</span></span><div><span id="timer">01:30.0</span> <small>LEFT</small><span class="divider">/</span><span id="score">000000</span> <small>PTS</small><span class="desktop-stat"><span class="divider">/</span><span id="speed">180</span> <small>KM/H</small><span class="divider">/</span><span id="near">0</span> <small>CLOSE CALLS</small></span></div><button id="pause" aria-label="Pause game" disabled>Ⅱ PAUSE</button></div>
<div class="screen" id="screen">
<canvas id="game" width="640" height="360" tabindex="0" aria-label="BASTROP37. Steer with arrows or WASD. Hold Space to slide, Shift to trigger turbo, Command or Control to hold blades, Option or Alt to jump. P pauses. R restarts.">Your browser needs Canvas to run BASTROP37.</canvas>
<div class="overlay" id="overlay"><p class="eyebrow" id="overline">EXTRACTION RUN / 6.0 KM</p><h2 id="headline">BEAT THE<br/><em>COUNTDOWN.</em></h2><p id="message">Traffic first. Drones after the underpass.<br/>Reach the sea-wall gate before it seals.</p><button class="primary" id="start" disabled>LOADING ESCAPE…</button><p class="small" id="hint">ARROWS / WASD · SPACE SLIDE · SHIFT TURBO · CMD/CTRL BLADES · OPT/ALT JUMP</p></div>
<div class="charge"><span>ENERGY <b id="charge-value">100%</b></span><div><i id="charge-bar"></i></div><span id="feedback">SHIFT: TURBO · CMD/CTRL: BLADES · OPT/ALT: JUMP</span></div>
</div>
<div class="touch-controls"><div class="dpad"><button data-key="ArrowLeft" aria-label="Steer left">←</button><div><button data-key="ArrowUp" aria-label="Accelerate">↑</button><button data-key="ArrowDown" aria-label="Slow down">↓</button></div><button data-key="ArrowRight" aria-label="Steer right">→</button></div><div class="actions"><button class="slide-control" data-key="Space">SLIDE<span>HOLD + STEER</span></button><button data-key="ShiftLeft">TURBO<span>TAP · 40 ENERGY</span></button><button data-key="ControlLeft">BLADES<span>HOLD TO SLICE</span></button><button data-key="AltLeft">JUMP<span>TAP TO SPRING</span></button></div></div>
</section>
<footer class="notes"><p><b>01 / STEER</b><span>← → steer. ↑ ↓ adjust speed.</span></p><p><b>02 / SLIDE</b><span>Hold Space + steer. Release to grip.</span></p><p><b>03 / TURBO</b><span>Tap Shift. Costs 40 energy. Slides recharge.</span></p><p><b>04 / BLADES + JUMP</b><span>Hold Cmd/Ctrl to slice. Tap Opt/Alt to clear cars and lunges.</span></p><p class="utility">P — PAUSE &nbsp; R — RETRY<br/>KEYBOARD + TOUCH</p></footer>
<p class="development">A riding experiment by Vikram Ramkumar. Prototype sprites & mechanics. Escape six kilometers of traffic and drone pursuit before the sea-wall gate seals.</p>
<noscript><p>Enable JavaScript to ride. You can still browse the <a href="/bastrop37/assets/">asset garage</a>.</p></noscript>
</main>
<script>import { mountGame } from '../../scripts/bastrop37'; mountGame();</script>
</body></html>
